{"name":"Couch","hex":"#4e2a20","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Couch","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname.","An unincorporated community in Mason County, West Virginia, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Couch"}],"entries":[{"title":"Couch","blocks":[{"text":"A couch, also known as a sofa, settee, chesterfield, or davenport, is a cushioned piece of furniture that can seat multiple people. It is commonly found in the form of a bench with upholstered armrests and is often fitted with springs and tailored cushion and pillows. Although a couch is used primarily for seating, it may be used for sleeping. In homes, couches are normally put in the family room, living room, den, or lounge. They are sometimes also found in non-residential settings such as hotels, lobbies of commercial offices, waiting rooms, and bars. Couches can also vary in size, color, and design."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/2009-05-16_Main_office_lobby_at_Hampton_Forest_Apartments.jpg/330px-2009-05-16_Main_office_lobby_at_Hampton_Forest_Apartments.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Couch"},{"title":"Couch (American band)","blocks":[{"text":"Couch is a seven-piece soul-, funk-, and jazz-pop band from Greater Boston, Massachusetts, formed in 2018. Their sound is described as a blend of pop, R&B, jazz, and rock. On October 24, 2025, they released their debut album, Big Talk, and received five nominations for the Boston Music Awards at the end of the year."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Couch_(American_band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Loriots_Sofa.JPG/500px-Loriots_Sofa.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Loriots_Sofa.JPG/1280px-Loriots_Sofa.JPG?utm_sour